rge rate, pay rate, duration, pay amount and charge amount.","width":1080,"height":768}},{"key":"The hours become an invoice","title":"The hours become an invoice","text":"The bill is made from logged hours.","caption":"Before the invoice goes out, the timelog report can be attached: the logged rows behind the bill, each with its task, duration, date and type. Then it is created and sent, or previewed first.","screen":{"src":"/productively/wall/receivables-add-invoice-step-2.webp","alt":"Productively Add Invoice dialog, step 2: a line per project with duration, charge rate and amount; subtotal, tax, discount and total; the timelog report attached with its rows; and buttons to create and send the invoice or to preview it.","width":1080,"height":768,"end":true}}]}],null]]}]]}],null,[]]}]}]
